<title>MALAYSIA: Country Heights 6-mth net up 61.4 pct.</title>
<headline>Country Heights 6-mth net up 61.4 pct.</headline>
<dateline>KUALA LUMPUR 1996-11-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Period to August 31, 1996</p>
<p>			    (in million ringgit unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit		  42.0	  vs	  26.01</p>
<p>    Group shr (cents)	 28.0	  vs	  17.3</p>
<p>    Turnover		   152.20	 vs	  76.19</p>
<p>    Pre-tax profit	    63.07	 vs	  36.87</p>
<p>    Minorities less	    1.57	 vs  less   0.23</p>
<p>NOTE: Company's full name is Country Heights Holdings Bhd. It is involved in property development.</p>
<p>-- Kuala Lumpur newsroom (603 230 8911)</p>
</text>
